 \nL138: 【54†Inspire your students Book a school visit, classroom workshop or teacher-training session†learning.parliament.uk】 【55†Free teacher training resources Access videos, worksheets, lesson plans and games.†learning.parliament.uk】\nL139: \nL140: ### Keep up to date\nL141: \nL142:   * 【56†Sign up to our education newsletter†parliament.us16.list-manage.com】\nL143: \nL144: ## Shop\nL145: \nL146: Shop\nL147: \nL148: 【2†Close】 【2†Back】 【2†Close】\nL149: \nL150: ### In this section\nL151: \nL152:   * 【3†Shop home†www.shop.parliament.uk】\nL153: \nL154: 【57†UK Parliament】\nL155: # Salisbury Doctrine\nL156: \nL157:   1. 【58†All】\nL158:   2. 【59†A】\nL159:   3. 【60†B】\nL160:   4. 【61†C】\nL161:   5. 【62†D】\nL162:   6. 【63†E】\nL163:   7. 【64†F】\nL164:   8. 【65†G】\nL165:   9. 【66†H】\nL166:   10. 【67†I】\nL167:   11. 【68†J】\nL168:   12. 【69†K】\nL169:   13. 【70†L】\nL170:   14. 【71†M】\nL171:   15. 【72†N】\nL172:   16. 【73†O】\nL173:   17. 【74†P】\nL174:   18. 【75†Q】\nL175:   19. 【76†R】\nL176:   20. 【77†S】\nL177:   21. 【78†T】\nL178:   22. 【79†U】\nL179:   23. 【80†V】\nL180:   24. 【81†W】\nL181:   25. 【82†X】\nL182:   26. 【83†Y】\nL183:   27. 【84†Z】\nL184: The Salisbury Doctrine, or \"Convention\" as it is sometimes called, emerged from the working arrangements reached during the Labour Government of 1945-51, when the fifth Marquess of Salisbury was the Leader of the Conservative Opposition in the Lords. The Convention ensures that major Government Bills can get through the Lords when the Government of the day has no majority in the Lords.\nL185: In practice, it means that the Lords does not try to vote down at second or third reading, a Government Bill mentioned in an election manifesto.\nL186:   * 【85†Research briefing: The Salisbury Doctrine】\nL187:   * 【86†Related glossary term: Conventions】\nL188: ###### Popular\nL189: \nL190:   * 【87†What's on in Parliament†whatson.parliament.uk】\nL191:   * 【88†Petitions†petition.parliament.uk】\nL192:   * 【28†Careers at Parliament】\nL193:   * 【89†Commons Media Relations】\nL194:   * 【90†Lords Press Office】\nL195:   * 【91†Contact us】\nL196: \nL197: ###### Research\nL198: \nL199:   * 【92†Commons Library†commonslibrary.parliament.uk】\nL200:   * 【93†Lords Library†lordslibrary.parliament.uk】\nL201:   * 【94†POST†post.parliament.uk】\nL202: \nL203: ###### Search Parliament\nL204: \nL205: [Input]\nL206: \nL207: [Input]\nL208: \nL209: ###### Watch Parliament Live\nL210: \nL211: 【95†Parliament Live TV†parliamentlive.tv】\nL212: ###### Follow Parliament\nL213: \nL214: ###### Legal\nL215: \nL216:   * 【96†Accessibility statement】\nL217:   * 【31†Modern slavery statement】\nL218:   * 【97†About this site】\nL219:   * 【98†Privacy notice】\nL220:   * 【99†Cookie policy】\nL221:   * 【2†Cookie settings】\nL222: \nL223: © UK Parliament 2026\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nInternal Error ()\nciteturn0view2 [wordlim: 200] Source: open({\"ref_id\":\"https://www.dpmc.govt.nz/our-business-units/cabinet-office/supporting-work-cabinet/cabinet-manual/5-cabinet-decision-making-6\",\"lineno\":null}); \nURL https://www.dpmc.govt.nz/our-business-units/cabinet-office/supporting-work-cabinet/cabinet-manual/5-cabinet-decision-making-6 is not accessible via this tool."
